the text of "USDA SNAP FY 2026 maximum allotments and deductions" is at "sources/us/policies/usda/snap/fy-2026-cola/maximum-allotments.yaml".

the snap maximum allotment table for 1 is 298 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-10-01 <= D.

the snap maximum allotment table for 2 is 546 if
    the calculation date is a date D
    and 2025-10-01 <= D.

